# netman - Menu dotfiles-menu (label|command)
# Utilisation: dfm netman
Aide generale|netman help
Lookup DNS (exemple)|netman lookup example.com
Dig A/AAAA|netman dig example.com
Probe soft recon|netman probe example.com
Voisins ARP/NDP|netman neigh
Decouverte LAN|netman lan
DNS local|netman dns
Benchmark DNS|netman dns-bench
Whois|netman whois example.com
IP publique/locale|netman ip
Interfaces|netman interfaces
Connexions|netman connections
Ports|netman ports
Routage (lecture)|netman routing
Routeman show|netman routeman show
Diagnostic|netman diagnose
Firewall|netman firewall
Trace|netman trace 1.1.1.1
Menu TUI|netman menu
Quitter (ne rien faire)|true
